From: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Subject: [PATCH] gallium: add the Matrox M9 (m9x) driver

Registers the m9x Gallium driver (-Dgallium-drivers=m9x) in meson, the
pipe loader, the DRI and DRIL targets, and adds the m9x DRM UAPI header.
The driver sources themselves are src/gallium/drivers/m9x of this
repository.

Signed-off-by: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
---
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -169,7 +169,7 @@
     if ['x86', 'x86_64'].contains(host_machine.cpu_family())
       gallium_drivers = [
         'r300', 'r600', 'radeonsi', 'nouveau', 'virgl', 'svga', 'llvmpipe', 'softpipe',
-        'iris', 'crocus', 'i915', 'zink'
+        'iris', 'crocus', 'i915', 'zink', 'm9x'
       ]
     elif ['aarch64'].contains(host_machine.cpu_family())
       gallium_drivers = [
@@ -207,7 +207,7 @@
    gallium_drivers = [
      'r300', 'r600', 'radeonsi', 'crocus', 'v3d', 'vc4', 'freedreno', 'etnaviv', 'i915',
      'nouveau', 'svga', 'tegra', 'virgl', 'lima', 'panfrost', 'llvmpipe', 'softpipe', 'iris',
-     'zink', 'd3d12', 'asahi', 'rocket', 'ethosu'
+     'zink', 'd3d12', 'asahi', 'rocket', 'ethosu', 'm9x'
